fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266OPI","fragment":"\n\tGstH266OPI\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266OPI\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266OPI\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 operating point information.\nspecifies whether opi_ols_idx is present in the OPI.\nspecifies whether opi_htid_plus1 is present.\nspecifies that the current CVS and the next CVSs in decoding order\nup to and not including the next CVS for which opi_ols_idx is provided in\nan OPI NAL unit do not contain any other layers than those included in the\nOLS with OLS index equal to opi_ols_idx.\nspecifies that all the pictures in the current CVS and the next\nCVSs in decoding order up to and not including the next CVS for which\nopi_htid_plus1 is provided in an OPI NAL unit are IRAP pictures or GDR\npictures with ph_recovery_poc_cnt equal to 0.\nspecifies whether opi_extension_data_flag syntax elements\nare present.\ncould have any value.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 operating point information.\nspecifies whether opi_ols_idx is present in the OPI.\nspecifies whether opi_htid_plus1 is present.\nspecifies that the current CVS and the next CVSs in decoding order\nup to and not including the next CVS for which opi_ols_idx is provided in\nan OPI NAL unit do not contain any other layers than those included in the\nOLS with OLS index equal to opi_ols_idx.\nspecifies that all the pictures in the current CVS and the next\nCVSs in decoding order up to and not including the next CVS for which\nopi_htid_plus1 is provided in an OPI NAL unit are IRAP pictures or GDR\npictures with ph_recovery_poc_cnt equal to 0.\nspecifies whether opi_extension_data_flag syntax elements\nare present.\ncould have any value.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 operating point information.\nspecifies whether opi_ols_idx is present in the OPI.\nspecifies whether opi_htid_plus1 is present.\nspecifies that the current CVS and the next CVSs in decoding order\nup to and not including the next CVS for which opi_ols_idx is provided in\nan OPI NAL unit do not contain any other layers than those included in the\nOLS with OLS index equal to opi_ols_idx.\nspecifies that all the pictures in the current CVS and the next\nCVSs in decoding order up to and not including the next CVS for which\nopi_htid_plus1 is provided in an OPI NAL unit are IRAP pictures or GDR\npictures with ph_recovery_poc_cnt equal to 0.\nspecifies whether opi_extension_data_flag syntax elements\nare present.\ncould have any value.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});